      "row_index_0based": 32,
      "serialized_row_index": 32,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "それは……分かりませんけど、\nでも、雨女なんて迷信ですよ、偶然です。\nそんなに気にしないほうがいいと思いますけど。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "7f3a5dc96ec4dbe8c3baea7011ab08f12dfa6580526f0a026950c1f6b3e3615f",
